{"4301580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Greedy", "steam_appid": 4301580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/711f3a31ea231de705f580a1ab46135e.avif?t=1788184704\" width=1241 height=457 /></span>HOW FAR WILL YOU GO FOR MORE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your <strong>friends</strong> as <strong>goofy racoons</strong> to <strong>infiltrate</strong> <strong>procedural</strong> <strong>ancient ruins</strong> and <strong>extract the magic relic</strong> for the moles running the excavation, before the place (and your team) falls apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM vs SELFISHNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure is power… and a problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>relic reward</strong> is shared by <strong>everyone</strong>. But <strong>every extra item</strong> you grab <strong>boosts</strong> your <strong>individual progress</strong> while making you <strong>slower</strong> and <strong>noisier</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/8cb4b9974241954b3f4006c3e118dd3c.avif?t=1788184704\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras_big/8cb4b9974241954b3f4006c3e118dd3c.avif?t=1788184704 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHRED LOOT, BUY UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn <strong>loot into coins</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them on <strong>items</strong> and <strong>upgrades</strong>, gamble at the <strong>moles’ roulette</strong>, and, if you’re lucky, choose one of Mammon’s roguelike deals together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/587fdd3dbd1d5d55efe18fa60f9274a4.poster.avif?t=1788184704\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/587fdd3dbd1d5d55efe18fa60f9274a4.webm?t=1788184704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/587fdd3dbd1d5d55efe18fa60f9274a4.mp4?t=1788184704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KNOW WHEN TO LEAVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relic is only halfway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You still have to <strong>escape under pressure</strong>, then <strong>decide together</strong>: <strong>cash out or risk all </strong>in the next floor for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/72419e81e1d11da0041964d235746a95.poster.avif?t=1788184704\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/72419e81e1d11da0041964d235746a95.webm?t=1788184704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/72419e81e1d11da0041964d235746a95.mp4?t=1788184704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CURSE OF MAMMON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruins aren’t unguarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mammon, </strong>the <strong>Greed Demon</strong>, and his servants are watching. If the team steals too much, he <strong>curses the crew</strong>. Push deep enough and you’ll face <strong>bosses</strong>, clear new <strong>challenges</strong>, and rescue <strong>lost NPCs</strong> who settle in the forest and help the <strong>story</strong> unfold.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROCEDURAL RUINS, ENDLESS RUNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every floor reshuffles</strong>: layouts, traps, monsters, and puzzles change, so plans fall apart fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you’ve got: <strong>exploration, teamwork, skill, stealth, and quick thinking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/c5680f2a6ba5500e57f2c2ac7435d8f8.avif?t=1788184704\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras_big/c5680f2a6ba5500e57f2c2ac7435d8f8.webp?t=1788184704 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/711f3a31ea231de705f580a1ab46135e.avif?t=1788184704\" width=1241 height=457 /></span>HOW FAR WILL YOU GO FOR MORE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your <strong>friends</strong> as <strong>goofy racoons</strong> to <strong>infiltrate</strong> <strong>procedural</strong> <strong>ancient ruins</strong> and <strong>extract the magic relic</strong> for the moles running the excavation, before the place (and your team) falls apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM vs SELFISHNESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure is power… and a problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>relic reward</strong> is shared by <strong>everyone</strong>. But <strong>every extra item</strong> you grab <strong>boosts</strong> your <strong>individual progress</strong> while making you <strong>slower</strong> and <strong>noisier</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/8cb4b9974241954b3f4006c3e118dd3c.avif?t=1788184704\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras_big/8cb4b9974241954b3f4006c3e118dd3c.avif?t=1788184704 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHRED LOOT, BUY UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn <strong>loot into coins</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them on <strong>items</strong> and <strong>upgrades</strong>, gamble at the <strong>moles’ roulette</strong>, and, if you’re lucky, choose one of Mammon’s roguelike deals together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/587fdd3dbd1d5d55efe18fa60f9274a4.poster.avif?t=1788184704\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/587fdd3dbd1d5d55efe18fa60f9274a4.webm?t=1788184704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/587fdd3dbd1d5d55efe18fa60f9274a4.mp4?t=1788184704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KNOW WHEN TO LEAVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relic is only halfway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You still have to <strong>escape under pressure</strong>, then <strong>decide together</strong>: <strong>cash out or risk all </strong>in the next floor for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301580/extras/72419e81e1d11da0041964d235746a95.poster.avif?t=1788184704\" width=1138